#!/bin/bash
# Desktop: scoot headless, as user abc. Unlike the Selkies image's de service
# there is nothing to wait for here -- no X to probe with xset, no parent
# compositor socket: scoot IS the compositor and creates its own socket.
STARTWM=/defaults/startwm.sh
[ -x "$HOME/.config/startwm.sh" ] && STARTWM="$HOME/.config/startwm.sh"

cd "$HOME"
exec s6-setuidgid abc dbus-run-session --config-file=/usr/share/dbus-1/session.conf -- bash "$STARTWM"
